hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"334","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Zakariya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Buraid bin Abdullah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Burdah se, woh Hazrat Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek shakhs ko suna jo ek shakhs ki sana kar raha tha aur us ki had se zyada tareef kar raha tha, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum ne halak kar diya ya tum ne kaat di us shakhs ki peeth."
"335","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Imran bin Muslim se, woh Ibrahim Taimi se, woh apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Hazrat Umar ke paas baithe hue thay, to ek shakhs ne ek shakhs ki us ke munh par tareef ki, to unhon ne farmaya: Tu ne us shakhs ko aqir kar diya, Allah tujhe aqir kare."
"336","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdussalam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hafs ne bayan kiya, Ubaidullah se, woh Zaid bin Aslam se, woh apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Umar ko kehte hue suna: Tareef zabah hai, Muhammad ne kaha: yani jab usay qabool kar le."
"337","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Hazim ne mujh se bayan kiya, Suhail se, woh apne walid se, woh Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Abu Bakr kya hi achche aadmi hain, Umar kya hi achche aadmi hain, Abu Ubaida kya hi achche aadmi hain, Usaid bin Hudair kya hi achche aadmi hain, Sabit bin Qais bin Shammas kya hi achche aadmi hain, Muaz bin Amr bin Jamuh kya hi achche aadmi hain, Muaz bin Jabal kya hi achche aadmi hain, unhon ne kaha: Aur falan bura aadmi hai aur falan bura aadmi hai hatta ke saat gine."
"338","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Fulaih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman se, woh Abu Yunus jo Hazrat Aisha ke aazad karda ghulam hain un se, ke Hazrat Aisha ne farmaya: Ek shakhs ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se andar aane ki ijazat mangi, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Biradari ka bura beta hai, phir jab woh andar aaya to aap us se khush hue aur us ki taraf kushada hue, phir jab woh shakhs bahar nikla to doosre ne ijazat mangi, aap ne farmaya: Biradari ka achcha beta hai, phir jab woh andar aaya to aap us ki taraf utne kushada na hue jitne doosre ki taraf kushada hue thay aur na us se utne khush hue jitne doosre se khush hue thay, phir jab woh bahar nikla to main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, aap ne falan ke liye jo kaha so kaha phir us se khush hue, aur aap ne falan ke liye jo kaha so kaha aur main ne aap ko us jaisa karte na dekha, aap ne farmaya: Aisha, beshak badtareen logon mein se woh hai jis se us ki fahashi ki wajah se bacha jaye."
"339","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, Habib bin Abi Sabit se, woh Mujahid se, woh Abu Mamar se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs khada hua jo hakaamon mein se ek haakim ki tareef kar raha tha, to Hazrat Miqdad us ke chehre par mitti dalne lage aur farmaya: Hamein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hukm diya hai ke hum tareef karne walon ke chehron par mitti dalein."
"340","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne bayan kiya, Ali bin Hakam se, woh Ata bin Abi Rabah se ke ek shakhs Hazrat Ibn Umar ke paas ek shakhs ki tareef kar raha tha to Hazrat Ibn Umar us ke munh ki taraf mitti dalne lage aur farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum tareef karne walon ko dekho to un ke chehron par mitti dalo."
"341","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, woh Abdullah bin Shaqiq se, woh Raja bin Abi Raja se, woh Mihjan Aslami se, Raja ne kaha: Main ek din Mihjan ke saath aaya hatta ke hum Basra walon ki masjid tak pahunche, to Buraida Aslami masjid ke darwazon mein se ek darwaze par baithe hue thay, unhon ne kaha: Aur masjid mein ek shakhs tha jisay Sukba kaha jata tha, jo namaz lambi karta tha, phir jab hum masjid ke darwaze tak pahunche aur us par ek chadar thi aur Buraida mazaq karne wale sahab thay, to unhon ne kaha: Ai Mihjan, kya tu is tarah namaz parhta hai jaise Sukba namaz parhta hai, to Mihjan ne unhein jawab na diya aur wapas laut aaye, unhon ne kaha: Mihjan ne kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mera haath pakda, phir hum chalte hue nikle hatta ke hum Uhud par charhe, to aap ne Madina par nazar farmai phir farmaya: Us basti par us ki maan ka rona, jisay us ke rehne wale chhor dein ge jab ke woh jitni aabad hone wali hogi, Dajjal us ke paas aayega to us ke darwazon mein se har darwaze par ek farishta payega, to us mein dakhil na ho sakega, phir aap utre hatta ke jab hum masjid mein thay, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo namaz parh raha tha aur sajda aur ruku kar raha tha, to mujh se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Yeh kaun hai, to main us ki tareef karne laga, phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, yeh falan hai aur yeh hai, to aap ne farmaya: Ruk ja, usay na suna taake tu usay halak na kar de, unhon ne kaha: Phir aap chalte hue nikle hatta ke jab aap apne hujron ke paas thay, lekin aap ne apne haath jhare phir farmaya: Beshak tumhare deen mein se behtareen woh hai jo sab se aasan hai, beshak tumhare deen mein se behtareen woh hai jo sab se aasan hai, teen martaba."
"342","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, woh Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakra se, woh Aswad bin Sari se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya to main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, main ne taareefon aur madh ke zariye Allah ki madh ki hai aur aap ki bhi, to aap ne farmaya: Jaan le ke beshak tumhara Rab hamd ko pasand karta hai, to main unhein sunane laga, phir ek lambe qad wale ganje shakhs ne ijazat mangi, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: Khamosh ho ja, phir woh andar aaya, phir kuch der baat ki phir bahar nikla, to main ne unhein sunaya, phir woh aaya to mujhe khamosh kar diya, phir bahar nikla, aap ne do ya teen martaba aisa kiya, to main ne kaha: Yeh kaun hai jis ke liye aap ne mujhe khamosh kiya, aap ne farmaya: Yeh aisa shakhs hai jo baatil ko pasand nahin karta."
"343","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Nujaid bin Imran bin Husain Khuzaai ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid Nujaid ne mujh se bayan kiya ke ek shayar Imran bin Husain ke paas aaya to unhon ne usay diya, to un se kaha gaya: Aap ek shayar ko dete hain, to unhon ne farmaya: Main apni izzat ko bachata hun."
"344","Muhammad bin Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muaz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Aun ne bayan kiya, Muhammad se, unhon ne kaha: Woh kehte thay: Apne dost ki aisi cheez se khatir na kar jo us par shaaq guzre."
